OL,4,BF1 to introduce full-time race         
OL,5,Bstewards from 2027                     
OL,6,GFormula 1's governing body the FIA is  
OL,7,Gto introduce permanent race stewards   
OL,8,Gfrom the 2027 season.                  
OL,10,FThe move follows consistent calls from 
OL,11,Fgrand prix drivers for the change      
OL,12,Fbecause of criticisms of inconsistency 
OL,13,Fof decisions regarding penalties for   
OL,14,Fon-track incidents.                    
OL,16,FThe FIA said in a statement that it    
OL,17,Fwould begin recruiting permanent       
OL,18,Fstewards, and was planning a "phased   
OL,19,Fintroduction" during the 2027 season.  
